Package: redalycR
Type: Package
Title: Access and Bibliometric Analysis of Redalyc Metadata
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: c(person(given = "Henry", family = "Osorto", email = "henry.osorto@unah.edu.hn",
                    role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-4334-9179")))
Description: Provides tools to retrieve, clean, transform, and analyze 
    bibliographic metadata from Redalyc. The package supports reproducible 
    workflows for open bibliometric analysis, including conversion to a 
    bibliometrix-like data structure, keyword frequency analysis, and keyword 
    co-occurrence networks.
